; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on BTCUSD - trailing result M5 + SMA trailing, setup 2 of 6: buy, session 0700-1200 server time, trend filter M30 EMA 100, target 2R. DO NOT LOAD ON GOLD.
; Trailing: stop beyond the SMA(50) of M5 closes, from the minute after entry. Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 8, TrailParam 50).
; Picked on Jan 2025 - May 15 2026 only (score 1.45): 91 trades, PF 1.75.
; UNSEEN May 16 - Nov 13 2026: this setup 31 trades, PF 2.02, net +7.0R; the 6 setups of this combination together 205 trades, PF 1.51 (stressed 1.43).
; EARLIER DATA, before the calibration period: 2024: this setup 92 trades, PF 0.92; 2023: this setup 79 trades, PF 0.80. The combination together: 2024 PF 1.10 (462 trades); 2023 PF 0.71 (425 trades). The 2026 result did NOT hold on earlier data: UNPROVEN, demo and Strategy Tester only.
; Data: Binance BTCUSDT M1 in broker server time, assumed spread 10 USD. Points are 0.01 USD: 2000 points = 20 USD.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter was not in the backtest.
